    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "But isn't it pretty well established by most mainstream economists that capital flight is a real risk? like, if you tax wealth, people just move their money to tax havens. isn't that more of a proven fact than the idea that it actually helps inequality?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
